Top Level help

For help with a control or submenu, open it and press h.

Frequency navigation

Comma) Tune down
Full stop) Tune up
Set the tuning step by pressing s s.

Submenus

c) CW
d) Decoders
f) Filters
s) Settings

Top Level controls

a) AF gain
b) Band select
e) Frequency entry
g) Get SWR
i) CTCSS tone or DCS code
k) Lock tuning dial or front panel controls
l) Split VFOs or repeater configuration
m) Mode select
o) Offset (RIT or XIT clarifier)
p) Preamplifier
q) Quit YAC. Press y to confirm or n to cancel.
r) RF gain or FM squelch
t) Tune the connected antenna. Select the tuner in Settings with s t.
u) Attenuator
v) Verify status
w) Where am I? Read signal, frequency and mode.
x) Antennas
z) Round frequency to the nearest kHz

